    {
      "start_time": 20,
      "end_time": 45,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Mr Wickham picking up the handkerchief for Elizabeth initiates the start of their relationship, and acts as their initial \"meeting\". Mr Wickham makes a much better, more charming impression, than Mr Darcy. He acts as a barrier between the two because of his charm, but also because of his longstanding feud with Mr Darcy. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
